{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/a6b57928e716d1d2a210a54a186be84e.avif?t=1770980337\" width=616 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/d199376af225d9c232012f38ffd8600c.avif?t=1770980337\" width=615 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/1b3f2cd318a1ecd5c7c4240904d40213.poster.avif?t=1770980337\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/1b3f2cd318a1ecd5c7c4240904d40213.webm?t=1770980337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/1b3f2cd318a1ecd5c7c4240904d40213.mp4?t=1770980337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Millennium Strategy&quot; is a captivating single-player card game that merges the intricacies of strategic gameplay with the unpredictable nature of Roguelike elements, immersing players in a fantasy realm teeming with challenges and discoveries. With its exquisite card art and visual effects, every battle transforms into a spectacular visual experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/6017db563775527c3d778c48afe06c80.avif?t=1770980337\" width=615 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/9dc36950c83c560f4eefeceb3c634a38.avif?t=1770980337\" width=614 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In In the game, a deck is made up of heroes and cards. Players collect a variety of cards and unlock heroes with different abilities during the game. Before the game starts, players can fully customize their decks. As the game progresses, players can obtain additional cards to further enhance their decks. Before each battle, players can build the optimal deck to defeat enemies based on their team and available card resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/bb7bee7c12bd1a850fd745a52e9f0ce8.avif?t=1770980337\" width=615 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/da12803464c8f47d02f50c5babe1b844.avif?t=1770980337\" width=614 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the realm of fantasy, where intriguing opportunities and random events await. Use them to boost your power and defeat powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/ea20fe7af556672cb75375230bd5ce0e.avif?t=1770980337\" width=615 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/c0d246105ae344136d7fdda1f06463b2.avif?t=1770980337\" width=614 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat in &quot;Millennium Strategy&quot; is fast-paced, requiring players to make decisions within a continuous flow of time. The timing, combination, and sequence of hero attacks, skill unleashing, and card deployment directly influence the outcome of battles. This dynamic system keeps players engaged and challenged, as each choice can be pivotal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/ef82a287345ad3a62f58c4c722a9dd12.avif?t=1770980337\" width=615 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/09dcdca6ed2c283d9b5d80c813543774.avif?t=1770980337\" width=614 height=340 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Books: After a victorious battle, players have the chance to acquire books of various philosophical types, which confer bonuses or introduce new combat mechanics for the entire team. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Equipment: Equipping heroes with different weapons allows players to tailor their combat strategies to their preferences, creating a personalized playstyle for each character. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Advancement and Enhancement: Skill points earned from battles can be allocated to improve the descriptive effects and abilities of heroes. Through wise distribution of these points, players can continuously strengthen their hero teams, ensuring a dynamic and evolving gaming experience. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/e7cb6a402dd853dc2ad1d4774a23ed8e.avif?t=1770980337\" width=615 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/e5e3d473a67cbe7130f21b489d6c4d81.avif?t=1770980337\" width=614 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports direct in-game mod creation for card making, with full support for visual interaction, no need to reverse-engineer the game, nor install dozens of GBs of editors and IDEs. The game includes a built-in text editor, requiring just a couple of images and a few lines of Lua code. It also provides a rich feature panel, with syntax, interfaces, and common functions to help players create quickly.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2903630?t=1770980337","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2903630?t=1770980337","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/4d914251af909d8deb9d6328c303d12606cf69ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770980337","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/4d914251af909d8deb9d6328c303d12606cf69ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770980337","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game contains some revealing clothing and is not suitable for all ages: General Mature Content."},"demos":[{"appid":3043600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/a6b57928e716d1d2a210a54a186be84e.avif?t=1770980337\" width=616 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/d199376af225d9c232012f38ffd8600c.avif?t=1770980337\" width=615 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/1b3f2cd318a1ecd5c7c4240904d40213.poster.avif?t=1770980337\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/1b3f2cd318a1ecd5c7c4240904d40213.webm?t=1770980337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/1b3f2cd318a1ecd5c7c4240904d40213.mp4?t=1770980337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Millennium Strategy&quot; is a captivating single-player card game that merges the intricacies of strategic gameplay with the unpredictable nature of Roguelike elements, immersing players in a fantasy realm teeming with challenges and discoveries. With its exquisite card art and visual effects, every battle transforms into a spectacular visual experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/6017db563775527c3d778c48afe06c80.avif?t=1770980337\" width=615 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/9dc36950c83c560f4eefeceb3c634a38.avif?t=1770980337\" width=614 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In In the game, a deck is made up of heroes and cards. Players collect a variety of cards and unlock heroes with different abilities during the game. Before the game starts, players can fully customize their decks. As the game progresses, players can obtain additional cards to further enhance their decks. Before each battle, players can build the optimal deck to defeat enemies based on their team and available card resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/bb7bee7c12bd1a850fd745a52e9f0ce8.avif?t=1770980337\" width=615 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/da12803464c8f47d02f50c5babe1b844.avif?t=1770980337\" width=614 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the realm of fantasy, where intriguing opportunities and random events await. Use them to boost your power and defeat powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/ea20fe7af556672cb75375230bd5ce0e.avif?t=1770980337\" width=615 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/c0d246105ae344136d7fdda1f06463b2.avif?t=1770980337\" width=614 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat in &quot;Millennium Strategy&quot; is fast-paced, requiring players to make decisions within a continuous flow of time. The timing, combination, and sequence of hero attacks, skill unleashing, and card deployment directly influence the outcome of battles. This dynamic system keeps players engaged and challenged, as each choice can be pivotal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/ef82a287345ad3a62f58c4c722a9dd12.avif?t=1770980337\" width=615 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/09dcdca6ed2c283d9b5d80c813543774.avif?t=1770980337\" width=614 height=340 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Books: After a victorious battle, players have the chance to acquire books of various philosophical types, which confer bonuses or introduce new combat mechanics for the entire team. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Equipment: Equipping heroes with different weapons allows players to tailor their combat strategies to their preferences, creating a personalized playstyle for each character. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Advancement and Enhancement: Skill points earned from battles can be allocated to improve the descriptive effects and abilities of heroes. Through wise distribution of these points, players can continuously strengthen their hero teams, ensuring a dynamic and evolving gaming experience. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/e7cb6a402dd853dc2ad1d4774a23ed8e.avif?t=1770980337\" width=615 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/extras/e5e3d473a67cbe7130f21b489d6c4d81.avif?t=1770980337\" width=614 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports direct in-game mod creation for card making, with full support for visual interaction, no need to reverse-engineer the game, nor install dozens of GBs of editors and IDEs. The game includes a built-in text editor, requiring just a couple of images and a few lines of Lua code. It also provides a rich feature panel, with syntax, interfaces, and common functions to help players create quickly.</p>","developers":["MiMo Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903630/4720d9ac080b48f649d23f820bb00057e33a93cd/header.jpg?t=1770980337","is